{
  "name": "Ghamalim guide 5 - Inbox actions (update, tag, note, contacts, templates, forms)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0a7ee6b7-050c-4ea0-871c-a18018c177b1",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "1bb4fca8-d8c6-44cc-87d8-1fe1d44016d3",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ghamalim guide 5: Inbox actions\nClick **Execute workflow**: the steps that are switched on only read.\n\nGrey steps change a real conversation or contact, or send a real message. Activate one (select it, press **D**) only when you mean it.\n\nEvery change is recorded in Ghamalim as made by the member who created the API key.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "09bc8abf-8582-4291-b8e3-b3d7a9c195af",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Find the right tickets\n**Get Many** takes filters: status, priority, assignee (or *Nobody* for unassigned), group, channel, contact, tag, created after and updated after. They combine.",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eedbb291-d066-44b4-bf76-7130e942fd86",
      "name": "Unassigned pending tickets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 5,
        "filters": {
          "status": "pending",
          "assignedAgentId": "unassign"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "da0a68d6-3623-4de5-81cf-a145bccdf134",
      "name": "Changed in the last day",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 5,
        "filters": {
          "updatedAfter": "={{ $now.minus({ days: 1 }).toISO() }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "87a97761-9135-494c-bd48-71c8723e2f6e",
      "name": "Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Update a ticket\nResolve, reopen, put on hold, snooze, change the priority, or assign. Only the fields you add are changed. Resolving also sends the satisfaction survey when one is set up.",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d529992c-0e9f-4e80-9d99-bef65f54c48b",
      "name": "Pick a ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 1,
        "filters": {
          "status": "pending"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5aa3ef34-fb2a-4388-b4c8-8f08b04459a7",
      "name": "Set priority to high",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "update",
        "ticketId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "ticketUpdateFields": {
          "priority": "high"
        }
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "CHANGES that ticket.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ee68e308-a74c-4758-9cd9-459876871a1d",
      "name": "Snooze until tomorrow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "update",
        "ticketId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Pick a ticket').item.json.id }}"
        },
        "ticketUpdateFields": {
          "snoozedUntil": "={{ $now.plus({ days: 1 }).toISO() }}"
        }
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "HIDES that ticket until tomorrow.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "7b42d699-b2ba-4c2a-8a34-f69ba623eef8",
      "name": "Note 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Assign to a team\n**Assigned Group** hands the ticket to a team. A group with smart assignment also picks one of its members. Use **Assigned Agent** for one person, or *Nobody* to unassign.",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "72804e8d-f0c5-4f35-865f-3c66aeb019c6",
      "name": "List groups",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "group",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bffad5cc-6c5e-4cb2-90ba-e79aaebc95fe",
      "name": "Assign to the group",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "update",
        "ticketId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": ""
        },
        "ticketUpdateFields": {
          "assignedGroupId": "={{ $json.id }}"
        }
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "ASSIGNS a ticket. Paste a Ticket ID first.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6567a6a9-427d-45ff-b472-b7efb65273ae",
      "name": "Note 5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Tags\n**Add Tag** by name creates the tag when it does not exist yet. Both steps are safe to repeat: `changed` says whether anything happened.",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4d061ee2-55ff-4866-968e-2c515ad282fb",
      "name": "Pick a ticket (tags)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        780
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 1,
        "filters": {
          "status": "pending"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb7c0d1b-50f1-416b-8d66-cc43bea6489f",
      "name": "Add tag \"follow-up\"",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        780
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "addTag",
        "ticketId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "tagBy": "name",
        "tagName": "follow-up"
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "TAGS that ticket.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "0a5a8808-2fb6-4be3-9767-0cb037ea1938",
      "name": "Remove the tag again",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        780
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "removeTag",
        "ticketId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Pick a ticket (tags)').item.json.id }}"
        },
        "tagId": "={{ $json.tags[0].id }}"
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "Removes the first tag of that ticket.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "77c123e5-732b-4766-bfe1-d7ea83360f31",
      "name": "Note 6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        980
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 5. Internal notes\nA note is shown to the team inside the conversation and is never sent to the customer. Good for handing over context from another system.",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3438179-4637-4241-9908-9995f651c439",
      "name": "Pick a ticket (notes)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        1040
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 1,
        "filters": {
          "status": "pending"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "885dfa75-fe6d-4f21-af26-f4d0ff785cfa",
      "name": "Add a note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        1040
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "addNote",
        "ticketId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "noteContent": "Order #1042 was refunded in the shop system."
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "ADDS a note to that ticket.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "aa6e8f54-8381-4cbb-8a2a-d2d9e4c75a62",
      "name": "Read the notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        1040
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "getNotes",
        "ticketId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Pick a ticket (notes)').item.json.id }}"
        },
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b4eb0abd-a010-4284-bc93-e4ea70c8dd1b",
      "name": "Note 7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        1240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 6. Create or update a contact\nLooks the contact up by phone, email or your own ID, updates it when found and creates it when not. The result says which in `created`. Attributes are added to the existing ones.",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad56ff20-7285-4c47-ab0e-5ae9c72da19e",
      "name": "Save a lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        1300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "matchOn": "email",
        "firstName": "Ana",
        "email": "ana@example.com",
        "phone": "",
        "contactAdditionalFields": {
          "lastName": "Reyes",
          "attributes": {
            "values": [
              {
                "name": "source",
                "value": "website form"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "CREATES or changes a contact.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "14d6f408-c869-4a49-a4ba-7f33e48bc4fa",
      "name": "Note 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        1500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 7. WhatsApp template\nThe way to write first, or after WhatsApp's 24-hour window closed. Sending to a phone number starts the conversation when there is none. The template must be approved: see guide 3 for the list.",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ab690f81-de0b-4929-b701-754d78810a6e",
      "name": "Send a template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        1560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendTemplate",
        "templateSendTo": "phone",
        "channelId": "",
        "toPhone": "",
        "templateName": "hello_test_1",
        "templateLanguage": "en_US",
        "bodyParams": {},
        "templateOptions": {
          "idempotencyKey": "={{ $execution.id }}-{{ $itemIndex }}"
        }
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "SENDS a real WhatsApp message. Choose the channel and enter the phone number first.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "fdb8627c-3813-4dca-bf03-2007efbc31ca",
      "name": "Note 9",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        1760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 8. Send a form\nSends one of your forms as a link in the conversation. The answers arrive with the **Form Submitted** trigger (guide 7) and in **Form: Get Responses** (guide 6).",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "23224e5e-f4f9-44cf-9f32-f03ae4e9cc0e",
      "name": "List forms",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        1820
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "form",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "89f7a3f7-6072-4756-89c8-9b5489e5b788",
      "name": "Send the form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ghamalim.ghamalim",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        1820
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "sendForm",
        "ticketId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": ""
        },
        "formId": "={{ $json.id }}",
        "formOptions": {
          "idempotencyKey": "={{ $execution.id }}-{{ $itemIndex }}"
        }
      },
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "SENDS a real message. Paste a Ticket ID first.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    }
  ],
